  "description": "Our Adventure 1 WSD is the perfect companion on your daily commute and on to the trails beyond, tailored specifically to perform better for the female frame. Offering pedal-assist riding with its Shimano E5000 drive system and large capacity battery, you’ll be able to ride faster and longer with ease, on or off-road.\nThe Adventure 1 WSD eBike helps you to go wherever you need faster and with less effort than a conventional bike can. Designed with a step-through frame, it’s easy to access on and off the bike and is very comfortable to ride. With 3 power modes to choose from, you can decide how much assistance you would like. The Adventure 1 WSD is a great way not only to get about a city, but off-road on the weekends, finding itself more than comfortable on a gravel path or campsite trail.\nThe Adventure 1 WSD is a ‘pedal assist’ eBike rather than the old ‘twist throttle’ system. This is much safer and more efficient to improve range, with an easy to use handlebar mounted control unit. The Adventure WSD ebike uses the Shimano STEPS E5000 system.",
